Thus we need BRFSS data for each year 2018-2023 on prevalence of driving after drinking (drunk driving). The data likely available as BRFSS reports by year, with "driving after drinking too much" prevalence by state. We need states that consistently are > 4% in all six years.

Approach: search for "BRFSS 2018 driving after drinking prevalence by state" search result, fetch year, capture table, parse for >4%. However doing for each year manually may be long. We could try find compiled table summarizing 2018-2023 maybe "BRFSS State Data for Driving After Drinking".

Search web.

